Python Control Flow :
Title: Dictionary functions

Concept:
You can loop through:
dic.keys() → only keys
dic.values() → only values
dic.items() → both keys and values together

Tech used :
Language : pyhton
Compiler : Visual Studio Code

Logic Flow:
.keys() → retrieves all keys
.values() → retrieves all values
.items() → returns key–value pairs as tuples, making it easy to loop through both

Input :
dic_1 = {1: 'suriya', 2: 'yazhi', 3: 'sangeetha'}

Outpu :
Keys:
1
2
3

Values:
suriya
yazhi
sangeetha

Keys and Values:
1 : suriya
2 : yazhi
3 : sangeetha
